ugh a pre-configured agent proxy (CA bundle: /root/.ccr/ca-bundle.crt). If a tool fails TLS verification, gets 403/405/407 from the proxy, or a transfer is cut off (connection reset, unexpected disconnect, RPC failed), see /root/.ccr/README.md and run curl -sS \"$HTTPS_PROXY/__agentproxy/status\" for per-tool fixes and proxy state; never disable TLS verification or unset HTTPS_PROXY. Installed CLIs preconfigured for the proxy: bq, gcloud, gh, gsutil — prefer a skill/MCP tool, then these, over raw curl.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"remote_projects","cwd":"/home/user/bordercall","sessionId":"cbdcd57f-bcf8-5a71-ab64-4f0b9fbdb74f","version":"2.1.314","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"zany-kindling-liskov"}
